      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (7a), by inserting after the word “equipment” the words “, or on the alteration or renovation of premises”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_IV__cl_66__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_IV__cl_66",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (7 b) the following subsection: “(7ba) An amount equal to the expenditure incurred by a chargeable person on the provision of infrastructure in relation to his business which is available for public use, subject to the prior approval of the Minister: Provided that where a deduction has been made under this paragraph, no further deduction of the same amount shall be allowed under subsection 22(1).”. Amendment of section 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_IV__cl_67",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
