      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Chapter has effect for the year of assessment 2009 and subsequent years of assessment. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "71",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Labuan Offshore Business Activity Tax Act 1990, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 2(3)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the word “or” at the end of paragraph (a);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (c) the word “; or”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_71",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(d) an offshore business activity carried on by an offshore company which makes an election under section 3a.”. New section 3a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V__cl_72",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "72",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 3 the following section: “Offshore business activity chargeable to Income Tax Act 1967 upon election 3a. (1) Notwithstanding any other provision of this Act, an offshore company carrying on an offshore business activity may make an irrevocable election in the prescribed form that any profit of the offshore company for any basis period for a year of assessment and subsequent basis period to be charged to tax in accordance with the Income Tax Act 1967 in respect of that offshore business activity. (2) The election referred to in subsection (1) shall be made and furnished to the Director General three months prior to the beginning of the basis period for a year of assessment: Provided that for the basis period ending on a day in the year of assessment 2008, the election under this section may be made and furnished before 1 February 2008.”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act shall apply for the purposes of this Part unless otherwise provided."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where there is any inconsistency between any provision of this Part and any provision of the principal Act, that provision of the principal Act shall be void to the extent of the inconsistency. Balance for credit"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this Part, the balance for the credit of a company as at 31 December 2007 (hereinafter referred to in this Part as “108 balance”) shall consist of—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount of the balance for the credit of that company at the end of the basis period for a year of assessment 2007 ascertained under subsection 108(8) of the principal Act prior to the coming into operation of this Act;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount of the balance for the credit of that company ascertained under section 23 of the Income Tax (Amendment) Act 2000 [Act A1093] as at 31 December 2007; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the basis period of the company for the year of assessment 2007 ends—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "on a day other than 31 December 2007, any tax paid during the period from the first day of the basis period of that company for the year of assessment 2008 to 31 December 2007; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_1__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "on 31 December 2007, the final instalment paid under section 107c of the principal Act in respect of that basis period."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except as provided in subparagraph (c)(ii), any tax paid or tax charged on any assessment or composite assessment made after 31 December 2007 shall not be added to the 108 balance or revised 108 balance."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_39",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this section, “tax paid” has the same meaning assigned to it in subsection 108(14) of the principal Act prior to the coming into operation of this Act. Dividend paid or credited by company"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a dividend is paid or credited by a company to any of its shareholders at any time during the period from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the company has a 108 balance or revised 108 balance on the day before the dividend is paid or credited, and, if the dividend is deemed by virtue of section 14 of the principal Act to be derived from Malaysia, the company shall be entitled to deduct tax at the rate applicable to the company at the date the dividend is paid or credited."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The dividend paid or credited under subsection (1) shall consist of dividend paid in cash in respect of ordinary shareholding."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_40",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this Part, “ordinary shareholding” means holding of share other than share which carries only a right to any dividend which is of a fixed amount or at a fixed rate per cent of the nominal value of the shares, or a fixed rate per cent of the profits of the company. Dividend paid or credited on or before 31 December 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_41",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "41",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where the basis period of a company for the year of assessment 2007 ends on a day other than 31 December 2007 and the company paid or credited dividend to its shareholders during the period from the first day of the subsequent basis period to 31 December 2007, then, if the dividend is deemed by virtue of section 14 of the principal Act to be derived from Malaysia, the company shall be entitled to deduct tax at the rate applicable to the company at the date the dividend is paid or credited. Tax deemed deducted"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company pays, credits or distributes without deduction of tax a dividend from which it is entitled to deduct tax under this Part, the dividend shall be deemed to be dividend of such gross amount as determined in accordance with the formula— 1 x B (1-A) where A is the rate applicable to the company at the time of payment, crediting or distribution of dividend; B is the amount in fact paid or credited, or where section 41 applies and the dividend consists of property other than money, the amount of the market value of that property at the time of distribution of the dividend, and a sum equal to the difference between that gross amount and the amount in B in the above formula shall be deemed to have been deducted from the dividend as tax. Revision in tax rate"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any other provision of this Part, where a dividend is paid, credited or distributed with or without deduction of tax under this Part, and there is a revision in the rate of tax for companies for any year of assessment (in this section referred to as the “revised rate”), the amount of the dividend received by the shareholder shall be deemed to be a dividend of such gross amount as determined in accordance with the formula— 1 x B (1-A) where A is the revised rate applicable to the company at the time of payment, crediting or distribution of dividend; B is the amount in fact paid or credited, or where section 41 applies and the dividend consists of property other than money, the amount of the market value of that property at the time of distribution of the dividend, and a sum equal to the difference between that gross amount and the amount in B in the above formula shall be deemed to have been deducted from the dividend as tax. Certificate to shareholder"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every company shall upon paying, crediting or distributing to a shareholder a dividend of a kind to which section 40 or 41 applies (whether tax is deducted therefrom or not) furnish the shareholder with a certificate setting forth in respect of the dividend—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the gross dividend paid to the shareholder;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount of tax—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "which the company is entitled to deduct under section 40 or 41; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "deemed to have been deducted by the company under section 42; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount in fact paid or credited or where section 41 applies and the dividend consists of property other than money, the amount of the market value of that property at the time of distribution of the dividend. Statement to Director General"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 40 applies, the company shall—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "within 30 days from the date dividend is paid or credited to its shareholders, furnish to the Director General a statement in the prescribed form containing such particulars as may be required for the purpose of ascertaining the 108 balance or revised 108 balance; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "notwithstanding subparagraph (i), within 7 months following the close of the accounting period which constitutes the basis period of the company for year of assessment 2008, 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, or 2014 (if applicable) furnish to the Director General a statement in the prescribed form containing particulars as may be required for the purpose of determining the 108 balance or revised 108 balance, or any excess under section 48 at the end of that basis period;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 41 applies, the company shall within 30 days from 31 December 2007 furnish to the Director General a statement in the prescribed form containing such particulars as may be required for the purpose of ascertaining the 108 balance or any excess under section 48; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the company is not entitled to deduct tax on dividend paid or credited during the period from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013, the company shall within 7 months following the close of the accounting period which constitutes the basis period of the company for year of assessment 2008, 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, or 2014 (if applicable) furnish to the Director General a statement in the prescribed form containing particulars of such dividend paid or credited."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The failure of the company to comply with subsection (1) is an offence under subsection 120(1) of the principal Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_45",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A statement under this section may be furnished to the Director General in accordance with section 152a of the principal Act. Revised 108 balance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where during the period from the first day of the basis period for year of assessment 2008 to 31 December 2013—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the tax charged on the chargeable income of a company for the year of assessment 2000 on a current year basis and prior year of assessment is discharged or remitted; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_46",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any amount of tax paid by that company which has been taken into account for the purpose of computing the 108 balance is refunded, the 108 balance of the company, shall on the day the tax is discharged, remitted or refunded, be reduced by such amount of tax discharged, remitted or refunded (in this Part referred to as “revised 108 balance”). Reduction of 108 balance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company has paid or credited dividend to any of its shareholders—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "on any date during the period from the first day of the basis period for year of assessment 2008 to 31 December 2007, in the case where the basis period of a company for the year of assessment 2007 ends on a day other than 31 December 2007; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_47",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "on any date during the period from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013, from which tax has been deducted or deemed to have been deducted in accordance with this Part, the 108 balance or revised 108 balance shall be reduced first by the amount of tax so deducted or deemed to have been deducted in respect of paragraph (a) until the 108 balance or revised 108 balance is reduced to nil. Dividend paid in excess of revised 108 balance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "48",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where section 46 applies and a company has deducted tax on any dividend paid or credited to its shareholders in accordance with this Part, and the amount deducted exceeds the revised 108 balance, the excess shall be a debt due from the company to the Government and that debt shall be due and payable on the due date."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where any excess due and payable by a company under subsection (1) has not been paid by the due date, that excess as is unpaid upon the expiration of that date shall, without any further notice being served, be increased by an amount equal to ten per cent of the excess so unpaid, and the amount unpaid and the increase on the amount unpaid shall be a debt due from the company to the Government and that debt shall be payable forthwith to the Director General."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_48",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this section, “due date” means the last day of the seventh month from the date following the close of the accounting period of the company to which period section 44 applies. Non-deduction of tax"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "49",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A company shall not be entitled to deduct tax from any dividend paid or credited to its shareholder if—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as at 31 December 2007 the 108 balance of that company is nil;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as at any date from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013 the 108 balance or reduced 108 balance is reduced to nil pursuant to section 47; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the company has exercised an irrevocable option under section 50."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is not entitled to deduct tax under this section from a dividend paid or credited to any of its shareholders; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "issues to any of its shareholders certificates which purport to show that an amount of tax has been deducted under this Part from dividend paid or credited to the shareholders, an amount equal to what would have been the total amount of tax deducted or deemed to have been deducted, if sections 40, 41 and 42 had been applicable, from the gross amount of the dividend (ascertained in accordance with section 42) paid or credited to all its shareholders at the time that the dividend was paid or credited to those shareholders shall be an amount due from the company to the Government and that amount shall be increased by an amount not exceeding the amount due; and the Director General shall serve on the company a written requisition in the prescribed form calling upon the company to pay the amount due and the increase on the amount due, and that amount shall be a debt due from the company to the Government and that debt shall be payable forthwith to the Director General upon the service of the requisition: Provided that where the company satisfies the Director General that such certificate has been issued only to particular shareholders specified by the company, that debt shall be reduced to an amount ascertained by reference to the certificates issued to those particular shareholders."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_49",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where a company is not entitled to deduct tax on any dividend paid or credited pursuant to subsection (1), the provisions of the principal Act shall apply to such dividend. Option to disregard balance"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_50",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "50",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding that a company has a 108 balance or revised 108 balance at any time during the period from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013, the company may in that period exercise an irrevocable option in the prescribed form not to deduct tax under section 40 and where such option is made, the company shall not be entitled to deduct tax under that section upon the exercise of the option. Set-off under section 110"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 110 of the principal Act, prior to the amendment of that section under this Act, shall apply to a person other than an offshore company (excluding chargeable offshore company) in respect of any tax deducted under this Part: Provided that that person shall not be entitled to any set-off under that section if—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the case where section 40 applies, dividend is paid or credited to that person during the period from the date that person acquires the shares from which such dividend is paid or credited to the date of the disposal of such shares and that period is less than 90 days; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the dividend paid or credited is not in respect of dividend derived from ordinary shareholding."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purpose of this section—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any reference in subsection 110(1) of the principal Act prior to the amendment of that section under this Act to “tax which is deducted from any dividend under section 108” shall be construed as references to “tax which is deducted from any dividend under section 40 or 41 of this Part”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any reference in subsection 110(13) of the principal Act prior to the amendment of that section under this Act to “tax has been deducted under subsection 108(1) or deemed to have been deducted under subsection 108(2)” and “excess referred in subsection 108(6) or (9)” shall be construed as references to “tax which is deducted or would be deducted under section 40 or 41 of this Act” and “excess in section 48 of this Act” respectively; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_51__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "acquisition of shares referred to in paragraph (1)(a) shall not include acquisition of shares in the company listed on Bursa Malaysia. 108 balance or revised 108 balance after 31 December 2013"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding any other provision of this Part, if the 108 balance or revised 108 balance of the company has not been utilized in part or in full as at 31 December 2013, such balance shall be disregarded. Statutory income deemed total income"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where for the basis period for a year of assessment, gross income of a company is from a source consisting of dividend paid or credited to that company under this Part, the statutory income of that company for that year in respect of that source is deemed to be the total income or part of the total income of that company for that year. Debt discharge"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A payment made in discharge or partial discharge of debt of the kind mentioned in sections 48 and 49 shall be regarded as a payment of tax for the purpose of section 111 of the principal Act. Power to remit"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the foregoing sections of this Part, where—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the excess is increased by an amount under section 48; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_55",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the amount due is increased by an amount under section 49, the Director General may in his discretion, for any good cause shown, remit the whole or any part of that amount and, where the amount remitted has been paid, the Director General shall repay the same. Tax shall be deducted"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every company which has a 108 balance or revised 108 balance and has paid or credited dividend at any time during the period from 1 January 2008 to 31 December 2013 shall deduct tax from the dividend in accordance with section 40 unless the company has exercised an irrevocable option under section 50. Non-applicability"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Part shall not apply in respect of any dividend or part thereof which is debited to the exempt account or in respect of any dividend or part thereof which is exempt under subparagraph 5(6) of Schedule 7a of the principal Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 44 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
