      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 7, 9, �� and �3 are deemed to have effect for the year of assessment 2006 and subsequent years of assessment."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 32 is deemed to have come into operation on 2� February 2007. Amendment of section 3b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Income Tax Act �967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 3b by inserting after the words “offshore company” the words “, other than an offshore company (in this Act referred to as “chargeable offshore company”), which has made an election under section 3a of the Labuan Offshore Business Activity Tax Act �990”. Amendment of section 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 5(�) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the proviso to that subsection the following proviso: “Provided that in ascertaining the chargeable income of— (i) an individual resident in Malaysia there shall be excluded the income consisting of interest accruing in or derived from Malaysia and received from a person referred to in subsection �09C(4) in respect of interest paid or credited to that individual; or (ii) a participant other than a participant which is a resident company there shall be excluded any income accruing in or derived from Malaysia and received from a takaful operator referred to in subsection �09e(2) in respect of such income paid or credited to that participant.”. Amendment of section 6"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 6(�) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (i) a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (i) the following paragraph: “(j) subject to the provision of section �09e but notwithstanding any other provisions of this Act, income tax shall be charged for each year of assessment upon the income of a participant, other than a participant which is a resident company, which consists of profits distributed or credited by an operator referred to in section 60aa at the appropriate rate as specified under Part XI of Schedule �.”. Amendment of section 27"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 27 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (�) the following subsection: “(1a) Where gross income from a source in Malaysia of a company consists of any amount of discount or premium from the subscription or issuance of bond, as the case may be, and first becomes receivable in the relevant period, that amount shall be deemed to accrue over the whole period of the bond and the gross income of the company for the relevant period that relates to the period of the bond shall be a sum to be determined in accordance with the following formula: AxC B where A is the number of days in the relevant period that falls within the period of the bond; B is the total number of days of the whole period of the bond; and C is the total amount of discount or premium in respect of the bond: Provided that the Director General may allow the company to consistently apply any other formula which is in accordance with the generally accepted accounting principles applicable during the relevant period.”;"
      }
    },
    {
